{"id":"n68090-1-8","stage":1,"title":"오랜만 · 好久","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68090-1-8-1","ko":"얘들아, 오늘은 아버지 생신이셔서 저녁에 외식을 할 계획이야.","zh":"大家，今天是爸爸的生日，所以我们打算晚上去外面吃饭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얘들아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"얘：喂；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"얘","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67257","senseId":"2","lemma":"얘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버지","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생신이셔서","meaning":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","explanation":"생신：寿辰，诞辰，生日；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외식을","meaning":"在外用餐，外餐","explanation":"외식：在外用餐，外餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"외식","audio":"/audio/1bbd94acaee739271f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69119","senseId":"1","lemma":"외식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계획이야.","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1ad358ceb1fa5d83","term":"얘","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3","entryId":"67257","definition":"大人叫孩子时，或者年龄相等的人之间招呼时用的词语。","pronunciation":["얘ː"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"17bf3766fa611ae9","term":"생신","zh":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3","entryId":"16595","definition":"(敬语)人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생신"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"1bbd94acaee73927","term":"외식","zh":"在外用餐，外餐","audio":"/audio/1bbd94acaee739271f6e.mp3","entryId":"69119","definition":"在家外面就餐；或指那样的就餐。","pronunciation":["외ː식","웨ː식"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/538406ffd503357bc887.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68090-1-8-2","ko":"우리 오늘 오랜만에 포식하겠네요.","zh":"我们今天可要好好大吃一顿了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"포식하겠네요.","meaning":"饱餐，吃饱","explanation":"포식하다：饱餐，吃饱；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"포식하다","audio":"/audio/cd5460145cd5ee746941.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83380","senseId":"1","lemma":"포식하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"cd5460145cd5ee74","term":"포식하다","zh":"饱餐，吃饱","audio":"/audio/cd5460145cd5ee746941.mp3","entryId":"83380","definition":"吃得很多，吃得饱饱的。","pronunciation":["포ː시카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d0676aa023e68bea3bd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.04,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68090","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1736,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们今天可要好好大吃一顿了。","你知道敏俊的手机号码吗？","大家，今天是爸爸的生日，所以我们打算晚上去外面吃饭。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们今天可要好好大吃一顿了。","大家，今天是爸爸的生日，所以我们打算晚上去外面吃饭。","你知道敏俊的手机号码吗？"],"answer":0}]}
